# SEO Standards & Structured Data

The primary goal of `my-app` is high organic search rankings and rich search engine snippet presentation for POS and e-commerce keywords.

## Invariant Rules

- **No Double Branding (CRITICAL)**: The root layout template in `src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx` automatically appends `| Cashvio` (`%s | Cashvio`). NEVER include `"Cashvio"` or `"| Cashvio"` in page title strings in `messages/{en,ar}.json`.
- **Keyword-First Page Titles**: Place the primary target keyword at the very beginning of the title string (e.g., `"Free POS System & Cloud Cashier"`, `"كاشير مجاني ونظام نقاط بيع سحابي"`).
- **Concise Descriptions**: Meta descriptions MUST be 140–160 characters, include target keywords naturally, and finish with a strong value differentiator.
- **Centralized Metadata Builder**: ALWAYS use `buildPageMetadata()` from `@/lib/seo/page-metadata` in `generateMetadata()`. Never hand-roll `Metadata` objects.
- **Deterministic Canonical & Hreflang**: Let `buildPageMetadata()` construct canonical URLs and hreflang alternatives (`en`, `ar`, `x-default` -> English).
- **Schema via `schemaTemplates`**: Build structured JSON-LD schemas ONLY via `@/config/seo` templates, serialize with `serializeSchema()`, and render as `<script type="application/ld+json">` in the server component body.
- **Freshness Invariant**: Update `contentLastUpdated` in `src/config/seo.ts` ONLY when meaningful content or features change. NEVER use dynamic timestamps like `new Date()` for `lastModified`.
- **Zero Fabricated Schema Data**: Never fabricate review ratings, review counts, or fake pricing tiers in JSON-LD.

## ❌ FORBIDDEN vs ✅ REQUIRED

### 1. Page Title Formatting in Translations

```json
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Brand appended in translation string (renders "Free POS System | Cashvio | Cashvio")
// messages/en.json -> metadata.freePos
{
  "title": "Cashvio — Free POS System for Retail"
}

// ✅ REQUIRED — Keyword-first title without brand suffix (renders "Free POS System for Retail | Cashvio")
// messages/en.json -> metadata.freePos
{
  "title": "Free POS System for Retail & Cashier"
}
```

### 2. generateMetadata Implementation

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Hand-rolled metadata with manual alternate links
export async function generateMetadata({ params }: { params: { locale: string } }) {
  return {
    title: 'Free POS',
    alternates: {
      canonical: `https://cash-vio.com/${params.locale}/free-pos`, // Broken on EN!
    },
  };
}

// ✅ REQUIRED — Standardized buildPageMetadata helper
import { buildPageMetadata } from '@/lib/seo/page-metadata';
import { type Locale } from '@/i18n/routing';

interface Props {
  params: Promise<{ locale: string }>;
}

export async function generateMetadata({ params }: Props) {
  const { locale } = await params;
  return buildPageMetadata({
    locale: locale as Locale,
    path: '/features/free-pos',
    namespace: 'metadata.freePos',
    keywords: {
      en: ['free pos system', 'retail cashier software', 'free point of sale'],
      ar: ['كاشير مجاني', 'نظام نقاط بيع مجاني', 'برنامج كاشير للمحلات'],
    },
  });
}
```

### 3. JSON-LD Structured Data in Server Components

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Inline unescaped script tag with manual JSON
<script
  type="application/ld+json"
  dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: JSON.stringify(mySchema) }} // XSS / parsing hazard
/>

// ✅ REQUIRED — schemaTemplates + serializeSchema helper
import { schemaTemplates, serializeSchema, siteConfig } from '@/config/seo';
import { setRequestLocale } from 'next-intl/server';
import { type Locale } from '@/i18n/routing';

export default async function Page({ params }: Props) {
  const { locale } = await params;
  setRequestLocale(locale);
  const typedLocale = locale as Locale;

  const pageUrl = `${siteConfig.url}${typedLocale === 'ar' ? '/ar' : ''}/features/free-pos`;

  const schemas = [
    schemaTemplates.webPage({
      url: pageUrl,
      name: 'Free POS System',
      description: 'Free cloud point of sale software.',
      locale: typedLocale,
    }),
    schemaTemplates.breadcrumbList({
      items: [
        { name: 'Home', url: siteConfig.url },
        { name: 'Features', url: `${siteConfig.url}/features` },
        { name: 'Free POS', url: pageUrl },
      ],
    }),
  ];

  return (
    <>
      <script
        type="application/ld+json"
        dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: serializeSchema(schemas) }}
      />
      {/* Page Content */}
    </>
  );
}
```
